  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n“Hunted Within: The Walls” is a gripping first-person horror survival game that throws you into a terrifying world inspired by the intensity of Maze Runner, the visceral combat of Dying Light, and the adrenaline-pumping stealth of Outlast.<p></p>\n<p>Lost with no memory, trapped behind massive walls, and must venture through eerie areas each delivers a unique horror experience, pushing your courage and curiosity to the limit.</p>\n<p>Face increasingly dangerous enemies, from silent stalkers in the forest to horrors lurking in the caves.</p>\n<p>Gather resources and blueprints to craft deadly weapons, items and survival gear that will help you stay alive.</p>\n<p>Uncover the truth hidden within the maze by hunting down rare Artifact Stones – essential keys throughout the story, and find out who’s behind all of this!<br>\n</p>",
